internal/oracle/testdata/literal_member_slot/m02_generic_method_identity.ts:5:14: Adamic 0.1 refuses a value of type <T>(x: T) => T seen as (x: R) => W, whose readonly field t becomes writable: a readonly field may hold something narrower than number, which a write of number would replace; keep t readonly in the type it's seen as, or copy the value ({ ...value }) (adamic/invariant-mutable)
